      "worked": "Replacing $x$ with $x+1$ produces the target factors. A downward translation of 2 units replaces $y$ with $y+2$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}y+2&=(x+1)((x+1)-1)((x+1)+1)\\\\y+2&=x(x+1)(x+2)\\\\y&=x(x+1)(x+2)-2\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe translation is left 1 unit and down 2 units.",
